  "description": "Memory Indexer SDK - Full-featured long-term memory management for LLM applications via MCP. Includes InMemory/SQLite storage, extensible embedding/completion interfaces, and OpenTelemetry observability.",
  "id": "MemoryIndexer.Sdk",
  "isPrerelease": false,
